rites because he shows so much love and support for the dancers. Oh... I forgot to mention there are several televisions where sports or fights are often on. They even have events for such! This is an overall great experience. I love this place and the people in it!!"},{"business_id":"1gIXS-c3kKPevh6mkHzxIg","review_id":"qv4IOLdvSsffx-dSw4cW9A","date":"2015-12-27T03:23:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9002437591552734,"text_excerpt":"This place was wild, the drinks were cold and we had a fun time. Lots of bars in this area and I'm not sure why we stopped here but we had a good time. We took advantage of a special someone out in front was offering, Look for their big sign and also a girl on a swing going in and out of the upper window. By the way I paid with my CC and so far no extra charges. Please read the other reviews!!"},{"business_id":"1gIXS-c3kKPevh6mkHzxIg","review_id":"JeMWa8tM2fFC38HgpW582w","date":"2013-05-01T01:35:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8946019411087036,"text_excerpt":"We bought a bottle of Jameson and got a whole VIP section for the UFC fights. Service was great from th bartenders to security to managers! They definitely treated us well. The dancers here are prettier and more talented than the other strip clubs on Bourbon."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
